{"seq":1,"slug":"recall-strategies","title":"召回策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-system-engineering/recall-strategies","wordCount":914,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"召回策略\">召回策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>召回（Recall/Retrieval）是推荐系统级联架构的第一阶段，从百万甚至亿级的全量物品库中快速筛选出千级候选集。召回的核心目标是在极低延迟内保证高召回率——确保用户可能感兴趣的物品不被遗漏。召回质量直接决定了后续排序阶段的性能上界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    POOL[(全量物品池)] --&gt; CH1[协同过滤召回]&#10;    POOL --&gt; CH2[向量召回]&#10;    POOL --&gt; CH3[热门召回]&#10;    POOL --&gt; CH4[实时兴趣召回]&#10;    POOL --&gt; CH5[地理位置召回]&#10;    CH1 --&gt; MERGE[合并去重]&#10;    CH2 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    CH3 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    CH4 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    CH5 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    MERGE --&gt; CANDIDATES[候选集 ~1000]\">graph TB\n    POOL[(全量物品池)] --&gt; CH1[协同过滤召回]\n    POOL --&gt; CH2[向量召回]\n    POOL --&gt; CH3[热门召回]\n    POOL --&gt; CH4[实时兴趣召回]\n    POOL --&gt; CH5[地理位置召回]\n    CH1 --&gt; MERGE[合并去重]\n    CH2 --&gt; MERGE\n    CH3 --&gt; MERGE\n    CH4 --&gt; MERGE\n    CH5 --&gt; MERGE\n    MERGE --&gt; CANDIDATES[候选集 ~1000]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>召回通道</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>覆盖维度</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I2I 协同</td>\n<td>ItemCF/Swing</td>\n<td>行为相似</td>\n<td>5ms</td>\n<td>核心通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>U2I 向量</td>\n<td>双塔 ANN</td>\n<td>语义匹配</td>\n<td>10ms</td>\n<td>泛化召回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热门</td>\n<td>TopK 热度</td>\n<td>全局趋势</td>\n<td>1ms</td>\n<td>冷启动兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时兴趣</td>\n<td>Session 物品扩展</td>\n<td>即时兴趣</td>\n<td>5ms</td>\n<td>实时响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签匹配</td>\n<td>用户标签→物品标签</td>\n<td>显式偏好</td>\n<td>3ms</td>\n<td>精准定向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人群包</td>\n<td>用户分群→物品集</td>\n<td>群体特征</td>\n<td>3ms</td>\n<td>运营定向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于向量的召回\">基于向量的召回</h2><p>向量召回使用深度学习模型将用户和物品编码为稠密向量，通过 ANN（近似最近邻）搜索找到与用户向量最相似的物品向量。双塔模型（Two-Tower Model）是向量召回的标准架构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TwoTowerModel {&#10;  userTower: MLPLayer[];&#10;  itemTower: MLPLayer[];&#10;  embeddingDim: number;&#10;  temperature: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function userTowerForward(userFeatures: Float32Array, tower: MLPLayer[]): Float32Array {&#10;  let hidden = userFeatures;&#10;  for (const layer of tower) {&#10;    hidden = relu(addVec(matVecMul(layer.weight, hidden), layer.bias));&#10;  }&#10;  return l2Normalize(hidden);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function itemTowerForward(itemFeatures: Float32Array, tower: MLPLayer[]): Float32Array {&#10;  let hidden = itemFeatures;&#10;  for (const layer of tower) {&#10;    hidden = relu(addVec(matVecMul(layer.weight, hidden), layer.bias));&#10;  }&#10;  return l2Normalize(hidden);&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface VectorRecallConfig {&#10;  indexType: &#39;hnsw&#39; | &#39;ivf_pq&#39;;&#10;  topK: number;&#10;  efSearch: number;&#10;  nprobe: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function vectorRecall(&#10;  userEmbedding: Float32Array,&#10;  index: ANNIndex,&#10;  config: VectorRecallConfig,&#10;): Promise&lt;Array&lt;{ itemId: string; score: number }&gt;&gt; {&#10;  return index.search(userEmbedding, config.topK);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TwoTowerModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userTower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MLPLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  itemTower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MLPLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  embeddingDim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> userTowerForward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MLPLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hidden </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userFeatures;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> layer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tower) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hidden </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> relu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addVec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matVecMul</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(layer.weight, hidden), layer.bias));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> l2Normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hidden);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> itemTowerForward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">itemFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MLPLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hidden </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> itemFeatures;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> layer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tower) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hidden </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> relu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addVec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matVecMul</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(layer.weight, hidden), layer.bias));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> l2Normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hidden);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VectorRecallConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indexType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hnsw'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ivf_pq'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  topK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  efSearch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  nprobe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> vectorRecall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userEmbedding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ANNIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VectorRecallConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">itemId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userEmbedding, config.topK);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>双塔模型的训练通常采用 Sampled Softmax 或 In-Batch Negatives 策略。关键挑战包括：样本选择偏差（点击数据不等于用户偏好）、曝光偏差校正（用户只看到了被推荐的物品）和负样本策略（随机负采样 vs 困难负采样的权衡）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"swing-与-i2i-召回\">Swing 与 I2I 召回</h2><p>I2I（Item-to-Item）召回基于物品之间的相似度进行推荐：用户历史交互的物品的相似物品构成候选集。Swing 是阿里巴巴提出的一种改进的 I2I 相似度计算方法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SwingConfig {&#10;| 负采样策略 | 方法 | 优势 | 劣势 | 适用阶段 |&#10;|-----------|------|------|------|---------|&#10;| 随机负采样 | 全局随机采样物品 | 简单高效 | 过于简单，区分度低 | 训练初期 |&#10;| In-Batch Negatives | 同 batch 内其他样本 | 无额外开销 | 受 batch 大小限制 | 通用 |&#10;| 困难负采样 | 采样排名靠前的负样本 | 区分度高 | 可能引入假负例 | 训练后期 |&#10;| 混合负采样 | 随机 + 困难按比例混合 | 兼顾效率和难度 | 超参数需调优 | 工业实践 |&#10;&#10;ANN（近似最近邻）索引的选择直接影响向量召回的在线性能。HNSW（Hierarchical Navigable Small World）在低延迟高召回率场景表现最优，是当前工业界的主流选择；IVF-PQ（Inverted File + Product Quantization）在内存受限场景更有优势，通过向量量化将存储开销压缩 10-50 倍。Faiss 和 Milvus 是最常用的 ANN 检索引擎。&#10;&#10;  alpha: number;&#10;  topK: number;&#10;  minSupport: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function swingSimilarity(&#10;  item1: string,&#10;  item2: string,&#10;  userItems: Map&lt;string, Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;,&#10;  config: SwingConfig,&#10;): number {&#10;  const users1 = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;  const users2 = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const [userId, items] of userItems) {&#10;    if (items.has(item1)) users1.add(userId);&#10;    if (items.has(item2)) users2.add(userId);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const commonUsers = [...users1].filter((u) =&gt; users2.has(u));&#10;  if (commonUsers.length &lt; config.minSupport) return 0;&#10;&#10;  let score = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; commonUsers.length; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = i + 1; j &lt; commonUsers.length; j++) {&#10;      const userI = commonUsers[i];&#10;      const userJ = commonUsers[j];&#10;      const commonCount = [...userItems.get(userI)!].filter((item) =&gt; userItems.get(userJ)!.has(item)).length;&#10;      score += 1 / (commonCount + config.alpha);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return score;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SwingConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 负采样策略 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 方法 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 优势 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 劣势 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 适用阶段 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|-----------|------|------|------|---------|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 随机负采样 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 全局随机采样物品 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 简单高效 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 过于简单，区分度低 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4